{"video":"vjujrxwzNgQ","lines":[{"t":[0,3],"en":"- I'm sure there's some friendly way to reconcile this."},{"t":[3,4.3],"en":"Have a seat."},{"t":[4.3,5.5],"en":"First of all, we haven't been introduced."},{"t":[5.5,7.2],"en":"I'm Monica Geller."},{"t":[7.2,9.9],"en":"- Oh my God, you are."},{"t":[9.9,11.5],"en":"- And you're Rachel Green."},{"t":[11.5,13.2],"en":"- Yeah."},{"t":[13.2,14.9],"en":"- Louisa Giannetti."},{"t":[14.9,16.2],"en":"Lincoln High."},{"t":[16.2,18.3],"en":"I sat behind you guys in Homeroom."},{"t":[20.2,21.8],"en":"- Louisa!"},{"t":[21.8,23.5],"en":"Oh my God!"},{"t":[23.5,25.8],"en":"- Monica, that's Louisa!"},{"t":[25.8,28.1],"en":"- Louisa from Homeroom!"},{"t":[28.1,28.9],"en":"- Yes!"},{"t":[30,32.3],"en":"- You have no idea who I am though."},{"t":[32.3,35],"en":"- No, not at all."},{"t":[35,39.6],"en":"- Well, maybe that's because you spent four years ignoring me."},{"t":[39.6,41.4],"en":"I mean, wouldn't it have been so hard to say,"},{"t":[41.4,43],"en":"\"Morning Louisa!\""},{"t":[43,45.8],"en":"Or, \"Nice overalls!\""},{"t":[50.6,52.2],"en":"- Oh, I'm so sorry."},{"t":[52.2,53.4],"en":"- It's not so much you."},{"t":[53.4,56.6],"en":"You were fat, you had your own problems."},{"t":[58.6,60.8],"en":"- But you, what a bitch."},{"t":[62.8,63.7],"en":"- What?"},{"t":[63.7,65.7],"en":"- All right, you know what, be that as it may."},{"t":[65.7,68.1],"en":"Do you think you could just help us out here on that monkey thing?"},{"t":[68.1,70.9],"en":"You know, just, for old time's sake?"},{"t":[70.9,72.4],"en":"Go, Bobcats?"},{"t":[73.4,75.5],"en":"I could, but I won't."},{"t":[76.6,78.8],"en":"If I find that monkey, he's mine."},{"t":[78.8,80.8],"en":"- Dun, dun, dun, dun!"}]}
